        "title": "At a glance",
        "items": [
          "Qualifying NEET is not the same as getting a seat: about 11 lakh qualified for roughly 1.2–1.4 lakh seats.",
          "The internship is compulsory before you can register and practise.",
          "Most doctors specialise later through a PG entrance (MD/MS)."
